<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">War of the Third Coalition</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1805">1805</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a> · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/napoleonic-wars">Napoleonic Wars</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The War of the Third Coalition (1805) was fought by Napoleonic <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> and its allies against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russia">Russia</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sweden">Sweden</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/naples">Naples</a>. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/napoleon">Napoleon</a> forced an Austrian army to surrender at Ulm and defeated the Austrians and Russians at Austerlitz on 2 December 1805, although Britain won control of the sea at Trafalgar. The Treaty of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bratislava">Pressburg</a> made Austria cede lands in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/germany">Germany</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a> and led to the end of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/holy-roman-empire">Holy Roman Empire</a> in 1806.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/war-of-the-third-coalition.jpg" alt="War of the Third Coalition" width="320" height="360" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Ruedi33a · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:War_of_the_3rd_coalition.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
